#: ../../../components/index.md:1 ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "Components"
msgstr "コンポーネント"

#: ../../../components/index.md:3
msgid ""
"Detailed usage of each component and guidelines for extending it. First "
"we show how the components fit together in the overall pipeline, then "
"move into page-by-page detail."
msgstr "各コンポーネントの詳しい使い方と拡張ガイドラインです。 まず全体のパイプラインでコンポーネント同士がどう組み合わさるかを示し、そのあとページ単位の詳細に入ります。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:6
msgid "Overall pipeline structure"
msgstr "パイプライン全体の構成"

#: ../../../components/index.md:8
msgid ""
"`Optimizer` bundles the following components and drives the generation "
"loop until `Termination` decides to stop. `OptimizationStrategy` "
"orchestrates the processing for a single generation. `Algorithm` "
"generates candidate solutions (ask), `SurrogateManager` scores them "
"cheaply, the strategy decides which candidates receive an expensive true "
"evaluation, and the result is reflected in both `Algorithm`'s population "
"(tell) and the `Archive`. `Archive` also doubles as the surrogate's "
"training data."
msgstr "`Optimizer`は以下のコンポーネントを束ね、`Termination`が終了と判定するまで世代ループを駆動します。 1世代分の処理は`OptimizationStrategy`が統括します。 `Algorithm`が候補解を生成し（ask）、`SurrogateManager`がそれを安価にスコアリングし、戦略がどの候補解に高コストな真の評価を割り当てるかを決め、結果は`Algorithm`側の個体群（tell）と`Archive`の両方に反映されます。 `Archive`はサロゲートの学習データも兼ねています。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:35
msgid ""
"Each stage fires typed events via `CallbackManager`, so you can observe "
"or intervene in the pipeline's progress without subclassing (see "
"[CallbackManager](callbacks.md))."
msgstr "各ステージは`CallbackManager`経由で型付きイベントを発火するため、サブクラス化せずにパイプラインの途中経過を観察したり操作したりできます（[CallbackManager](callbacks.md)を参照）。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:37
msgid "The role of each component is as follows."
msgstr "各コンポーネントの役割は次の通りです。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "Role"
msgstr "役割"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[Problem](problem.md)"
msgstr "[Problem](problem.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid ""
"Defines the objective function, design variables, search range, "
"constraints, and optimization direction"
msgstr "目的関数、設計変数、探索範囲、制約、最適化の方向(direction)を定義する"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[Initializer](initialization.md)"
msgstr "[Initializer](initialization.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "Generates the initial population and archive before the loop starts"
msgstr "ループ開始前に初期個体群とアーカイブを生成する"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[Algorithm](algorithm.md)"
msgstr "[Algorithm](algorithm.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid ""
"The evolutionary search itself (GA/PSO). `ask()` generates candidates, "
"`tell()` updates the population"
msgstr "進化的探索本体（GA/PSO）。`ask()`が候補解を生成し、`tell()`が個体群を更新する"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[OptimizationStrategy](strategies.md)"
msgstr "[OptimizationStrategy](strategies.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid ""
"Orchestrates one generation's pipeline and decides which candidates "
"receive a true evaluation"
msgstr "1世代分のパイプラインを統括し、どの候補解が真の評価を受けるかを決める"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[SurrogateManager](surrogate_manager.md)"
msgstr "[SurrogateManager](surrogate_manager.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "Bridges surrogate fitting and scoring, exposing `score_candidates()`"
msgstr "サロゲートのフィットとスコアリングを橋渡しし、`score_candidates()`を公開する"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[Surrogate](surrogate.md)"
msgstr "[Surrogate](surrogate.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid ""
"Fits and predicts using the archive's data. Knows nothing about how "
"scoring works"
msgstr "アーカイブのデータでフィットし予測する。スコアリングの方法は関知しない"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[AcquisitionFunction](acquisition_functions.md)"
msgstr "[AcquisitionFunction](acquisition_functions.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid ""
"Converts predictions into a scalar score (higher is better). Knows "
"nothing about the model's details"
msgstr "予測値を（高いほど良い）スカラースコアへ変換する。モデルの詳細は関知しない"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[Evaluator](evaluation.md)"
msgstr "[Evaluator](evaluation.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid ""
"Runs true evaluation (sequentially, or in parallel via the `parallel` "
"extra)"
msgstr "真の評価を実行する（逐次、または`parallel`エクストラによる並列）"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[Archive](population.md)"
msgstr "[Archive](population.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid ""
"Accumulates every truly evaluated point. Also doubles as the surrogate's "
"training dataset"
msgstr "真に評価済みの点をすべて蓄積する。サロゲートの学習データセットも兼ねる"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[Termination](termination.md)"
msgstr "[Termination](termination.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "Judges the loop's termination condition (default: maximum evaluations)"
msgstr "ループの終了条件を判定する（既定は最大評価回数）"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid "[CallbackManager](callbacks.md)"
msgstr "[CallbackManager](callbacks.md)"

#: ../../../components/index.md:13
msgid ""
"Observes and records events throughout the pipeline, and also enables "
"swapping components at runtime"
msgstr "パイプライン各所のイベントを観察して記録し、実行時のコンポーネント差し替えにも使う"

#: ../../../components/index.md:53
msgid "Assembling with the low-level API"
msgstr "低レベルAPIでの組み立て"

#: ../../../components/index.md:55
msgid ""
"Using `Optimizer` directly lets you swap out each component individually "
"via method chaining."
msgstr "`Optimizer`を直接使うと、各コンポーネントをメソッドチェーンで個別に差し替えられます。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:87
msgid ""
"The high-level API (`minimize()`/`maximize()`) is this same pipeline "
"auto-configured with sensible defaults. For research use cases that need "
"per-generation inspection or custom loop control, use `.iterate()` "
"instead of `.run()`. Worked examples using `.iterate()` can be found in "
"tutorials such as [Single-Objective "
"Optimization](../tutorials/single_objective.md)."
msgstr "高レベルAPI（`minimize()`/`maximize()`）は、このパイプラインを適切な既定値で自動構成したものです。 世代ごとの検査やカスタムループ制御が必要な研究用途では、`.run()`の代わりに`.iterate()`を使います。 `.iterate()`を使った実例は[単目的最適化](../tutorials/single_objective.md)などのチュートリアルにあります。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:91
msgid ""
"See [OptimizationStrategy](strategies.md) for how each strategy "
"configures this pipeline internally, and [Stage](stage.md) for the "
"contract of the individual stages that make up the pipeline."
msgstr "各Strategyが内部でこのパイプラインをどう構成するかは[OptimizationStrategy](strategies.md)を、パイプラインを構成するステージ単体の契約は[Stage](stage.md)を参照してください。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:97
msgid "Extension guidelines"
msgstr "拡張のガイドライン"

#: ../../../components/index.md:101
msgid ""
"For when subclassing is too heavy: `with_post`/`with_post_fit`, "
"`Pipeline`/`Stage`, `CallbackManager`, `Registry`."
msgstr "サブクラス化では重すぎる場合に：`with_post`/`with_post_fit`、`Pipeline`/`Stage`、`CallbackManager`、`Registry`。"

