msgstr "非優越ソートアルゴリズムの差し替え。crowding distanceやSPEA2 fitnessの計算も。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:146
msgid "Decomposition"
msgstr "Decomposition"

#: ../../../components/index.md:150
msgid ""
"MOEA/D-style scalarizing (decomposition) functions and "
