msgstr "MOEA/D風のスカラー化（分解）関数と`DecompositionComparator`。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:154
msgid "Search algorithms"
msgstr "探索アルゴリズム"

#: ../../../components/index.md:160
msgid "Algorithm"
