#: ../../../components/index.md:164
msgid "GA and PSO, and how to implement a custom `Algorithm`."
msgstr "GAとPSO、カスタム`Algorithm`の実装方法。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:167
msgid "Crossover"
msgstr "Crossover"

#: ../../../components/index.md:171
msgid ""
"BLX-α, SBX, uniform crossover, and more. When to use each for mixed-"
