msgstr "打ち切り選択などの生存選択（世代交代）方式。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:196
msgid "Surrogate modeling"
msgstr "サロゲートモデリング"

#: ../../../components/index.md:202
msgid "Surrogate"
msgstr "Surrogate"

#: ../../../components/index.md:206
msgid ""
"Built-in surrogates, external-library adapters, and how to implement a "
