msgstr "実行基盤と評価戦略"

#: ../../../components/index.md:244
msgid "Initializer"
msgstr "Initializer"

#: ../../../components/index.md:248
msgid ""
"How the initial population and archive are generated (LHS/Random/Sobol), "
