#: ../../../components/index.md:251
msgid "Evaluator"
msgstr "Evaluator"

#: ../../../components/index.md:255
msgid "Sequential and parallel backends for objective function evaluation."
msgstr "目的関数評価の逐次実行と並列実行のバックエンド。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:258
msgid "OptimizationStrategy"
msgstr "OptimizationStrategy"

#: ../../../components/index.md:262
msgid "Decides which candidates receive a true evaluation."
msgstr "どの候補解に真の評価を行うかを決定します。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:265
msgid "Termination"
msgstr "Termination"

#: ../../../components/index.md:269
msgid "How to combine termination conditions (`|`/`&`/`~`) and write your own."
msgstr "終了条件の組み合わせ方（`|`/`&`/`~`）と独自条件の書き方。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:273
msgid "Observation and core data structures"
msgstr "観察とコアデータ構造"

#: ../../../components/index.md:279
msgid "CallbackManager"
msgstr "CallbackManager"

#: ../../../components/index.md:283
msgid ""
"Observe the optimization pipeline, for logging and reaching into its "
"internals."
msgstr "最適化パイプラインを観察し、ログ記録や内部へのアクセスを行います。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:286
msgid "Stage"
msgstr "Stage"

#: ../../../components/index.md:290
msgid ""
"The stages that make up the generation loop inside "
"`OptimizationStrategy`. How to implement a custom `Stage`."
msgstr "OptimizationStrategy内部の世代ループを構成するステージ。独自Stageの実装方法。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:293
msgid "OptimizationState"
msgstr "OptimizationState"

#: ../../../components/index.md:297
msgid ""
"The state (ctx) that flows through the pipeline. Its main fields and "
"checkpointing."
msgstr "パイプラインを貫通する状態(ctx)。主要フィールドとチェックポイント。"

#: ../../../components/index.md:300
msgid "Population"
msgstr "Population"

#: ../../../components/index.md:304
